    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "And yet, as I look into his ice-blue eyes, I realize that—God help me—I do trust him",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1561
        },
        {
          "text": "He’s so nervous. My stomach flips at the realization. When he reaches out his hand for me, I take it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1790
        },
        {
