    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "There’s a hotel here that, at the time, was run as a sanatorium. Or, rather, a fake sanatorium",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3992
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wait,” I say, stopping in my tracks. “You don’t mean the Crescent City Hotel, do you?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4437
        },
        {
          "text": "It felt like I was helping the people who died here find justice",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5391
        }
