          "ok": true,
          "pos": 22263
        }
      ],
      "words": 67
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“It isn’t possible, though. Submerging myself will ruin the illusion.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 24563
        },
        {
          "text": "“The man I look like to you is",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 24743
        },
        {
          "text": "” He trails off, searching for the right words. “Only somewhat waterproof.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 24774
        },
        {
          "text": "“I want to kiss you again,” he murmurs. “I shouldn’t. We shouldn’t. But",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 25398
        },
        {
          "text": "” His face is so close",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 25466
        },
        {
          "text": "“Then I want to kiss you anyway.” And so I close the rest of the distance between us and press my lips to his",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 25974
        }
      ],
      "words": 74
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Devil take what I said last night,” he breathes",
          "ok": true,
